<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    />

    <title>Service Holder Application Approved</title>
</head>

<body
    style="
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f7f6;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    "
>
    <div
        style="
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 0;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
        "
    >
        <div
            style="
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                background-color: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 12px;
                overflow: hidden;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            "
        >
            <!-- Header -->
            <div
                style="
                    padding: 30px 25px;
                    text-align: center;
                    background-color: #00633c;
                "
            >
                <h1
                    style="
                        margin: 0;
                        color: #ffffff;
                        font-size: 28px;
                        font-weight: 700;
                    "
                >
                    DistrictFix
                </h1>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 8px 0 0;
                        color: #d9f2e7;
                        font-size: 14px;
                    "
                >
                    District-Based Home Service Management System
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Content -->
            <div style="padding: 35px 30px;">
                <h2
                    style="
                        margin: 0 0 15px;
                        color: #00633c;
                        font-size: 24px;
                    "
                >
                    Congratulations, <%= name %>!
                </h2>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 0 0 20px;
                        color: #444444;
                        font-size: 16px;
                        line-height: 1.7;
                    "
                >
                    We are pleased to inform you that your
                    <strong>Service Holder application</strong>
                    has been approved by the DistrictFix administration.
                </p>

                <!-- Application Details -->
                <div
                    style="
                        margin: 25px 0;
                        padding: 20px;
                        background-color: #f4f8f6;
                        border-left: 4px solid #00633c;
                        border-radius: 8px;
                    "
                >
                    <h3
                        style="
                            margin: 0 0 15px;
                            color: #00633c;
                            font-size: 18px;
                        "
                    >
                        Application Details
                    </h3>

                    <p
                        style="
                            margin: 8px 0;
                            color: #333333;
                            font-size: 15px;
                        "
                    >
                        <strong>Business Name:</strong>
                        <%= businessName %>
                    </p>

                    <p
                        style="
                            margin: 8px 0;
                            color: #333333;
                            font-size: 15px;
                        "
                    >
                        <strong>District:</strong>
                        <%= districtName %>
                    </p>

                    <p
                        style="
                            margin: 8px 0;
                            color: #333333;
                            font-size: 15px;
                        "
                    >
                        <strong>Role:</strong>
                        Service Holder
                    </p>

                    <p
                        style="
                            margin: 8px 0;
                            color: #333333;
                            font-size: 15px;
                        "
                    >
                        <strong>Status:</strong>
                        <span style="color: #00633c; font-weight: 700;">
                            Active
                        </span>
                    </p>
                </div>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 0 0 20px;
                        color: #444444;
                        font-size: 16px;
                        line-height: 1.7;
                    "
                >
                    You can now log in to your DistrictFix account and
                    access your Service Holder dashboard.
                </p>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 0 0 25px;
                        color: #444444;
                        font-size: 16px;
                        line-height: 1.7;
                    "
                >
                    As a Service Holder, you can manage service requests
                    within your assigned district and work with Plumbers
                    and Electricians.
                </p>

                <!-- Success Message -->
                <div
                    style="
                        padding: 15px 18px;
                        background-color: #eaf7f1;
                        border-radius: 8px;
                        text-align: center;
                    "
                >
                    <p
                        style="
                            margin: 0;
                            color: #00633c;
                            font-size: 15px;
                            font-weight: 600;
                        "
                    >
                        Your Service Holder account is now active.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 30px 0 0;
                        color: #444444;
                        font-size: 15px;
                        line-height: 1.7;
                    "
                >
                    Thank you for joining DistrictFix. We look forward to
                    working with you.
                </p>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 25px 0 0;
                        color: #333333;
                        font-size: 15px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                    "
                >
                    Best regards,<br />
                    <strong>DistrictFix Team</strong>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <div
                style="
                    padding: 20px 25px;
                    text-align: center;
                    background-color: #f4f7f6;
                "
            >
                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 0;
                        color: #777777;
                        font-size: 12px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                    "
                >
                    © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> DistrictFix.
                    All rights reserved.
                </p>

                <p
                    style="
                        margin: 6px 0 0;
                        color: #999999;
                        font-size: 11px;
                    "
                >
                    This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly
                    to this message.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>